In this phase, the basic idea for the project is identified and discussed.

Project Idea

PocketSmart AI is a smart budget recommendation web application that helps users plan their spending based on their available budget and preferences.

Main Objectives
Help users manage their budget.
Recommend suitable products based on budget.
Divide the budget among different categories.
Show planned spending and remaining balance.
Provide money-saving tips.
Main Categories
Home Decor
Event Planning
Jewelry Shopping

The user can also select a priority such as Best Quality, Balanced Value, or Lowest Price.
